#test/new_buggy/

# Local working documents (paper sources, experimental write-ups, figures).
# The two published docs -- methodology.md and DNF_Relevance_Checking.png --
# live at the repository root instead, so this needs no exceptions: git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, which makes `docs/`
# plus a `!docs/keep-me` negation silently ineffective.
docs/

